# 01_sleep_onset_RGB.ledc — Sleep Descent, RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 01_sleep_onset. Audio + speech IDENTICAL; LEDs re-authored for the
# concentric inner/outer RGB mask (inner ring = mask 9, outer ring = mask 6).
#
# VISUAL: warm radial sleep field — inner ring warm amber (255,160,32), outer ring
#   deep amber (255,80,0), run 180 ANTIPHASE with a SINE gate. Mean luminance stays
#   ~flat (invisible-flicker comfort) while the retina still gets the beat, and the
#   inner<->outer alternation is a slow warm radial breath. Both colours >=620 nm so
#   they pass the closed eyelid. 10->2 Hz (all <=10 Hz, never the 15-25 Hz band),
#   brightness capped <=30%, ramps in 10 s, Soft Off to 0. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]   (env 1=sine)

# --- Induction ~10 Hz, warm radial, brightness ramp-in over 10 s ---
0       >10 50 >0  255 160 32 9  1 0     # inner amber: 10 Hz sine, bright 0-> (10 s ramp-in)
0       >10 50 >0  255 80 0 6  1 180   # outer deep-red: antiphase radial
10000   10 50 ~25:30:10000 255 160 32 9 1 0    # inner: hold 10 Hz, breathing LFO 25<->30%
10000   10 50 ~25:30:10000 255 80 0 6 1 180  # outer: breathing (antiphase)
A 0     240 0 >0 0 1 250 0                # ch1 binaural: carrier 240 / R250 = 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
A 0     0 0 >0 0 3 0 5                    # ch3 pink-noise bed (wave 5); vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Beginning at ten hertz, in alpha. Let your breath slow and your body grow heavy."
A 30000 0 0 16 0 3 0 5                    # ch3 pink-noise bed steady at 16
A 45000 240 0 55 0 1 250 0                # ch1 vol 55, beat holds 10 Hz

# --- Deepening: glide 10->2 Hz over 18 min (~0.44 Hz/min); brightness descends ---
120000  >10 50 >25 255 160 32 9 1 0      # inner: freq 10->2, bright 25->8
120000  >10 50 >25 255 80 0 6 1 180    # outer: antiphase
A 120000 >240 0 55 0 1 250 0              # carrier 240->248 => beat 10->2 over 18 min
S 120000 default 65 "Drifting down now. Sinking through theta toward deep, slow delta."

# --- Soft Off begins at 2 Hz: brightness + volume fade to 0 together. No wake-up. ---
1200000 >2 50 >8 255 160 32 9 1 0        # inner: 2 Hz, bright 8->0
1200000 >2 50 >8 255 80 0 6 1 180      # outer: 2 Hz, bright 8->0
A 1200000 248 0 *55 0 1 250 0            # beat 2 Hz held; quad vol fade 55->0
A 1200000 0 0 *16 0 3 0 5                # pink-noise quad fade 16->0
S 1200000 default 65 "Falling into deep delta, two hertz. The sound and light are fading. Sleep now."

# --- End: dark + silent, no loop ---
1500000 2 50 0 255 160 32 9 1 0          # inner off
1500000 2 50 0 255 80 0 6 1 180        # outer off
A 1500000 248 0 0 0 1 250 0              # ch1 beat 2 Hz, vol 0
A 1500000 0 0 0 0 3 0 5                  # ch3 pink-noise vol 0
S 1500000 default 65 "Two hertz, deep sleep. Rest."
